            "text": "theorem Sn_eq_radial {h j Λ : ℝ} {P0 a : ℝ → ℝ} {f U V Pr : ℝ × ℝ → ℝ}\n    (hs : IsNaturalSolution h j Λ P0 a f U V Pr)\n    {p : ℝ × ℝ} (hp : p ∈ domain Λ) :\n    Sn h U V Pr p = -2 * NaturalAxisData.L h p.2 * radialDifferential 1 U p"
